"//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzb.jpg"}, {"id": 399144, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzc.jpg"}, {"id": 399145, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzd.jpg"}, {"id": 399146, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jze.jpg"}, {"id": 399147, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzf.jpg"}, {"id": 399148, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzg.jpg"}, {"id": 399149, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzh.jpg"}, {"id": 399150, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/sc8jzi.jpg"}], "slug": "gran-turismo-6-anniversary-edition", "summary": "Gran Turismo 6 is a racing video game and the sixth main installment\u2014and twelfth overall entry\u2014in the Gran Turismo series.\n\nNew features include the addition of more cars and tracks, enhanced car customization options, and partnerships with the Goodwood Festival of Speed, the Ayrton Senna Institute, the FIA, and NASA.\n\nIn the United States, the Anniversary Edition was available exclusively through GameStop and included:\n- 5 cars featuring special liveries and performance enhancements\n- Custom paint chips, race suit, helmet, and in-game avatars\n\nIn the United Kingdom, the Anniversary Edition was offered exclusively through GAME and included:\n- A Steelbook case\n- 20 cars with special liveries and performance enhancements\n- 1 million in-game credits\n- Apex II game guide app (e-book)\n- Custom paint chips, race suit, helmet, and in-game avatars", "themes": [{"id": 32, "name": "Non-fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/gran-turismo-6-anniversary-edition", "videos": [{"id": 40429, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "WeKQXamdWXw", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=WeKQXamdWXw", "title": "Gran Turismo 6 Opening Movie", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/WeKQXamdWXw/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 40428, "name": "Release Date Trailer", "video_id": "IRKbIXb9ShE", "url": "htt